# Backend API Documentation

This documentation provides the specifications for the Express + Prisma backend API, designed for consumption by the frontend AI agent.

## Base URL
`http://localhost:3000/api` (Adjust based on deployment environment)

## Standard Response Formats

**Success Response (200, 201)**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Operation successful",
  "data": { ... }, // Can be an object or array
  "meta": {        // Included for paginated responses (GET /all)
    "total": 50,
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 10,
    "totalPages": 5
  }
}
```

**Error Response (400, 401, 404, 500)**
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Error message description"
}
```

